ound\">Settings</h1>\n                <p className=\"text-muted-foreground mt-1\">\n                  Manage your account settings and preferences\n                </p>\n              </div>\n              <Badge variant=\"secondary\">\n                {getRoleDisplayLabel(user.role)}\n              </Badge>\n            </div>\n\n            {/* Verification Banner */}\n            {verification && !(verification.emailConfirmed || verification.isEmailVerified) && (\n              <Alert>\n                <AlertDescription>\n                  ΓÜá∩╕Å Your email is not verified. You won't appear in public search results until verified.\n                  <div className=\"mt-2 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                    <Button\n                      size=\"sm\"\n                      onClick={async () => {\n                        const ok = await resendEmailVerification();\n                        if (ok) setResendCooldown(60);\n                      }}\n                      disabled={resendCooldown > 0}\n                    >\n                      {resendCooldown > 0 ? `Resend in ${resendCooldown}s` : \"Resend Verification Email\"}\n                    </Button>\n                    <Link to=\"/verify-email\" className=\"text-primary underline\">Verify now</Link>\n                  </div>\n                </AlertDescription>\n              </Alert>\n            )}\n\n            {/* Settings Tabs */}\n            <Tabs defaultValue=\"notifications\" className=\"space-y-6\">\n              <TabsList className=\"grid w-full grid-cols-4\">\n                <TabsTrigger\n                  value=\"notifications\"\n                  className=\"flex items-center gap-2\"\n                >\n                  <Bell className=\"h-4 w-4\" />\n                  <span className=\"hidden sm:inline\">Notifications</span>\n                </TabsTrigger>\n                <TabsTrigger\n                  value=\"privacy\"\n                  className=\"flex items-center gap-2\"